{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55402","headline":"十玄谈（幷序） 破还乡曲（《大正》本、《偈颂》作「还源」） · 常察","name":"十玄谈（幷序） 破还乡曲（《大正》本、《偈颂》作「还源」）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"返本还源事亦差，本来无住不名家。\n万年松径雪深覆，一带峰峦云更遮。\n宾主默时纯（《大正》本、《偈颂》作「穆时全」）是妄，君臣道合（《大正》本、《偈颂》作「合处」）正中邪。\n还乡曲调如何物（《大正》、《偈颂》作「唱」）？\n明月堂前枯木（《大正》本、《偈颂》作「树」）华。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"常察","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55402.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55402","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}